#: ../../source/index.rst:5
msgid "UniSDK — Telink Unified Software Development Kit"
msgstr "UniSDK — Telink 统一软件开发套件"

#: ../../source/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"UniSDK is Telink's unified software development platform, providing "
"consistent development experience across all Telink chip series. SDK "
"adopts modular, extensible architecture, integrating modern build tools "
"like CMake, Ninja, West, and Kconfig, forming a complete compilation and "
"build workflow. This documentation includes all user manuals, API "
"references, and technical guides."
msgstr ""
"UniSDK 是 Telink 的统一软件开发平台，在所有 Telink 芯片系列上提供一致的开发体验。SDK 采用模块化、可扩展的架构，集成了 CMake、Ninja、West 和 Kconfig 等现代构建工具，形成完整的编译和构建工作流。本文档包含所有用户手册、API 参考和技术指南。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Document Status**: ``STABLE`` indicates content is complete and ready "
"for use; ``DRAFT`` indicates content is under development. Issues and PRs"
" are welcome to help improve documentation."
msgstr ""
"**文档状态**：``STABLE`` 表示内容已完成并可供使用；``DRAFT`` 表示内容正在开发中。欢迎提交 Issue 和 PR 以帮助改进文档。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:24
msgid ""
":octicon:`cpu` **Multi-Chip Unified Platform** — One codebase, one build "
"system, covering TL321X / TL721X / TLSR922X / TLSR952X full chip series"
msgstr ""
":octicon:`cpu` **多芯片统一平台** — 一套代码库，一个构建系统，覆盖 TL321X / TL721X / TLSR922X / TLSR952X 全系列芯片"

#: ../../source/index.rst:25
msgid ""
":octicon:`gear` **Modular Build System** — Flexible configuration based "
"on CMake + Kconfig, supporting three build entry points: West / Make / "
"CMake"
msgstr ""
":octicon:`gear` **模块化构建系统** — 基于 CMake + Kconfig 的灵活配置，支持三种构建入口：West / Make / CMake"

#: ../../source/index.rst:26
msgid ""
":octicon:`pulse` **Rich Peripheral Drivers** — Unified API layer "
"providing full series peripheral drivers: GPIO, UART, I2C, SPI, ADC, DMA,"
" USB, etc."
msgstr ""
":octicon:`pulse` **丰富的外设驱动** — 统一 API 层提供全系列外设驱动：GPIO、UART、I2C、SPI、ADC、DMA、USB 等"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27
msgid ""
":octicon:`broadcast` **BLE Protocol Stack** — Integrated BLE Controller, "
"supporting flexible wireless connectivity applications"
msgstr ""
":octicon:`broadcast` **BLE 协议栈** — 集成 BLE Controller，支持灵活的无线连接应用"

#: ../../source/index.rst:28
msgid ""
":octicon:`sun` **Low Power Management** — Comprehensive power management "
"framework, supporting multiple low power modes: Suspend / Retention, etc."
msgstr ""
":octicon:`sun` **低功耗管理** — 全面的电源管理框架，支持多种低功耗模式：Suspend / Retention 等"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid ""
":octicon:`graph` **Pinmux Visualization Tool** — Graphical pin "
"multiplexing configuration, simplifying hardware design"
msgstr ""
":octicon:`graph` **Pinmux 可视化工具** — 图形化引脚复用配置，简化硬件设计"

#: ../../source/index.rst:30
msgid ""
":octicon:`flame` **BDT Programming & Debugging** — One-click Flash "
"programming, reading, erasing via ``west tl-bdt``"
msgstr ""
":octicon:`flame` **BDT 烧录与调试** — 通过 ``west tl-bdt`` 一键 Flash 烧录、读取、擦除"

